Description: Hands-on BiocAsia workshop. Participants query curated
    Human Cell Atlas data with cellNexus, explore SingleCellExperiment
    objects with the tidyomics packages, test cell-type composition with
    sccomp, and test gene expression on donor-level pseudobulk.
